00:43:06,440 --> 00:43:09,640
-Her relations with men on campus have been promiscuous."
-She looks just like the girl from the dorm next to mine.

551
00:43:09,720 --> 00:43:11,480
-"She has posed for indecent photos."
-I just saw her a couple of days ago.

552
00:43:11,560 --> 00:43:13,080
-How shameless can you get?
-Right?...

553
00:43:13,160 --> 00:43:15,200
All right... break it up...

554
00:43:15,280 --> 00:43:16,560
-Stop looking...
-Come on...

555
00:43:16,640 --> 00:43:17,680
-That's enough looking.
-Quick, block it off.

556
00:43:17,760 --> 00:43:19,400
-Just one look, sir.
-You've seen plenty.

557
00:43:20,920 --> 00:43:21,800
Move along... come on.

558
00:43:21,880 --> 00:43:22,760
Move along...

559
00:43:23,680 --> 00:43:24,720
It's her.

560
00:43:25,520 --> 00:43:26,600
It really is her.

561
00:43:36,320 --> 00:43:38,760
This is an officer from the school's security office.

562
00:43:39,320 --> 00:43:41,560
This is Shen Mo.

563
00:43:43,000 --> 00:43:44,080
Come, sit down.

564
00:43:51,360 --> 00:43:52,920
Then we'll get straight to it.

565
00:43:53,480 --> 00:43:54,800
You work part-time at the Victoria?

566
00:43:55,560 --> 00:43:57,080
Yes, playing piano.

567
00:43:57,640 --> 00:44:00,000
Four days a week, two hours a day.

568
00:44:01,840 --> 00:44:02,880
What's the pay?

569
00:44:03,640 --> 00:44:04,600
Thirty a night.

570
00:44:04,680 --> 00:44:05,760
Settled once a week.

571
00:44:06,280 --> 00:44:09,240
Any other income at the Victoria?

572
00:44:09,320 --> 00:44:11,080
No, that's all.

573
00:44:11,600 --> 00:44:13,680
It's a part-time job. There's no other income.

574
00:44:13,760 --> 00:44:15,240
With people outside the school —

575
00:44:15,720 --> 00:44:17,720
any improper dealings?

576
00:44:19,560 --> 00:44:20,520
No.

577
00:44:24,880 --> 00:44:27,600
Has anyone ever offered you money for... transactions?

578
00:44:29,920 --> 00:44:31,120
What?

579
00:44:32,040 --> 00:44:33,520
You're an adult now,

580
00:44:34,120 --> 00:44:35,360
so I'll say it plainly.

581
00:44:35,440 --> 00:44:36,720
Drinking with clients, sleeping with clients —

582
00:44:37,280 --> 00:44:39,360
have you taken part in escort work?

583
00:44:48,800 --> 00:44:49,760
No.

584
00:44:53,840 --> 00:44:55,400
So what you're saying is,

585
00:44:55,920 --> 00:44:59,600
nothing in this letter of accusation is true?

586
00:45:06,440 --> 00:45:08,520
Then explain these photos.

587
00:45:09,560 --> 00:45:11,600
Is this you or not?

588
00:45:21,440 --> 00:45:22,400
Can I take the photos...

589
00:45:22,480 --> 00:45:24,240
Until this matter is cleared up,

590
00:45:24,320 --> 00:45:26,040
the photos stay here with me.

591
00:45:26,120 --> 00:45:29,160
Don't worry. No one else will see them.

592
00:45:31,720 --> 00:45:33,240
And what counts as "cleared up"?

593
00:45:35,960 --> 00:45:36,840
Shen Mo.

594
00:45:37,800 --> 00:45:39,960
First, you need to trust us completely.

595
00:45:40,760 --> 00:45:42,640
If you keep refusing to cooperate,

596
00:45:42,720 --> 00:45:44,800
the consequences could be very serious.

597
00:45:52,800 --> 00:45:53,720
Shen Mo.

598
00:45:59,640 --> 00:46:00,840
Shen Mo.

599
00:46:02,880 --> 00:46:03,840
Shen Mo.

600
00:46:04,800 --> 00:46:06,520
So what's the story with the photos and that letter?

601
00:46:06,600 --> 00:46:08,120
Is there nothing you want to tell me?

602
00:46:08,600 --> 00:46:10,640
Didn't Qu Bo already tell you everything?

603
00:46:11,480 --> 00:46:13,120
There's nothing I want to say right now.

604
00:46:13,200 --> 00:46:14,440
Just go home.

605
00:46:15,520 --> 00:46:17,320
What are you staring at? Go home and stare at your mom.

606
00:46:17,400 --> 00:46:18,600
What's wrong with you?

607
00:46:19,960 --> 00:46:21,040
Fine — you don't have to talk.

608
00:46:21,120 --> 00:46:22,440
What's past is past.

609
00:46:22,520 --> 00:46:23,920
I can put it out of my mind.

610
00:46:24,000 --> 00:46:25,720
But next time you're short of money, can't you just tell me?

611
00:46:25,800 --> 00:46:26,880
I can earn money, you know.

612
00:46:27,360 --> 00:46:28,600
Whatever you want to buy, whatever you want to do,

613
00:46:28,680 --> 00:46:29,880
you can tell me.

614
00:46:29,960 --> 00:46:31,760
Just stop taking up with those shady people out there.

615
00:46:31,840 --> 00:46:33,680
Don't let them think you're easy to push around.

616
00:46:38,080 --> 00:46:39,920
So you think I'm that kind of person too?

617
00:46:41,520 --> 00:46:42,360
That's not what I meant.

618
00:46:42,440 --> 00:46:44,040
I know exactly what you meant.

619
00:46:46,240 --> 00:46:47,520
Whether I did it willingly

620
00:46:47,600 --> 00:46:49,160
or was forced into it,

621
00:46:49,240 --> 00:46:51,360
I still need to earn your forgiveness. Is that it?

622
00:46:54,000 --> 00:46:55,600
I told you a long time ago.

623
00:46:57,720 --> 00:46:59,280
I'm not worth your love.

624
00:46:59,800 --> 00:47:01,200
I don't deserve to be with you.

625
00:47:01,280 --> 00:47:02,160
Do you understand me?

626
00:47:02,240 --> 00:47:04,480
If you finally understand, then go home.

627
00:47:04,560 --> 00:47:06,480
Let's never see each other again.

628
00:47:13,880 --> 00:47:15,640
Completely naked, they say,

629
00:47:15,720 --> 00:47:17,240
