693
00:52:19,480 --> 00:52:20,960
Pretty clothes to wear,

694
00:52:22,080 --> 00:52:23,520
and someone who loves me.

695
00:52:31,080 --> 00:52:33,560
Once you actually become me, you won't think that anymore.

696
00:52:42,040 --> 00:52:44,320
You can still tell your story to people.

697
00:52:48,200 --> 00:52:49,320
I can't.

698
00:53:00,640 --> 00:53:01,640
Shen Mo.

699
00:53:02,640 --> 00:53:04,200
Do we count as friends?

700
00:53:05,920 --> 00:53:07,120
Of course we do.

701
00:53:09,800 --> 00:53:11,880
Then whenever you feel like telling it,

702
00:53:12,760 --> 00:53:13,920
tell me.

703
00:53:20,360 --> 00:53:21,360
Okay.

704
00:53:28,360 --> 00:53:29,560
I'll go with you.

705
00:53:40,800 --> 00:53:47,000
(Yuanyuan Home-Style Restaurant)

706
00:53:47,080 --> 00:53:52,840
(Yuanyuan Home-Style Restaurant)

