00:54:57,240 --> 00:54:59,560
It's late. I need to get back to the dorm.

709
00:55:00,600 --> 00:55:02,000
Finish this glass first.

710
00:55:02,080 --> 00:55:03,680
I'll walk you back.

711
00:55:08,000 --> 00:55:08,920
To friends.

712
00:55:14,400 --> 00:55:15,600
To friends.

